              "text": "पाणिग्रहणम् (pāṇigrahaṇam) is built from pāṇi, \"the hand\", and grahaṇa, \"taking\", from the root √grah of गृह्णाति; MW gives it as pāṇi-graha, \"taking the bride by the hand, marriage\" (MW)."
